881..882 Other ";"
884..956 Comment "/// The operator\'s turn: at its own world, holding one capability to the"
957..1029 Comment "/// seat\'s, it runs the seat\'s work there and takes the report back. The"
1030..1106 Comment "/// migration spends the capability, and the report crosses because its type"
1107..1128 Comment "/// is marked mobile."
